# 统一换行符：仓库内与工作区一律使用 LF
# eol=lf 会覆盖 Windows 上系统级 core.autocrlf=true，检出时不再被转成 CRLF
* text=auto eol=lf

# 以下类型按二进制处理，禁止任何换行符转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.avif binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.eot binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.br binary
*.7z binary
*.xlsx binary
*.docx binary

# 文本类文件显式声明，避免被误判为二进制
*.md text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.ts text eol=lf
*.vue text eol=lf
*.scss text eol=lf
*.css text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf
*.svg text eol=lf
